{
 "answers": {
  "A": "Every mandatory finding of review 001 is met by the code; each named test fails on a verified copy of rejected-001 for the defect's reason (TR-01: own __main__ refused; TR-02: ALL_ROWS_MET despite the supervisor's refusal; TR-03: met from a stale probe.json, rows started on changed inputs; TR-04: four derived strings found in the rejected hygiene file; TR-05: no tool, and FC-P3 names no code). Two listed sub-checks fail for a renamed rule or a new field (TR2-02). All adopted nonmandatory findings are met; TR-14 is unchanged, as carried.",
  "B": "The identity rule is sound: the before-record precedes run_process, the supervisor calls on_started after Popen and before any poll, and file times on the evidence volume are precise wall-clock times (2,000 writes, 30-275 us after the write's start). The ctypes declarations match struct proc_bsdinfo (136 bytes; pid 12, ppid 16, uid 20, pgid 100, start 120/128) on this host, and W2's Kernel class agrees with my own offsets. Wall-clock steps, PID reuse, exited processes, zombies and permission errors all fail closed; every path without an identity sends nothing; no retry; absence only by ESRCH of killpg on a session-leader group. Details: TR2-04.",
  "C": "The new behaviour stays within MH-PLAN section 4 and P07 sections 3 to 6 and introduces no fail-open path; an interruption before a start is not recorded as UNKNOWN (TR2-01); the -B refusal is detective (TR2-05).",
  "D": "Fit for MH-PLAN section 4. Discovery equals the unit stage's (real in-place run: 5,994 IDs, 388 modules, order 32b2b861..., 407 of 407 additions, 5,587 base); the comparison is exact by sets; process creation is refused within FC-P7's limits. The collector runs the complete module unchanged, keeps every ID, outcome, class-level and unplanned event, and cannot turn a skip, error or missing method into a pass; its environment rule is the driver's plus an exact frozen environment. The runner makes one start per row through the bound Darwin supervisor, keeps everything, counts by P07 section 4, its predicates state P06-H01, P06-H02 and MC36 exactly, and no Node start follows a failed binding. The audit is independent, with the probe's inventory, thresholds, order and negative; T-10's 1e-9 is sound. The MC11 scan covers the named routes (TR2-03 for two dynamic routes), handles links and the inventory soundly and identifies the loader. The harness: T-01 holds; MC29's coverage is as stated (TR2-06); the recorder cannot let a start through; host-state is real. FAILURE-CAPTURE is complete. The suite reran 91 of 91.",
  "E": "No machine path, account name, personal name, e-mail address or package-manager name in tooling/, in any of five views (raw, squashed, reversed, joined literals, literal runs); two squashed false positives from 'CPython 3.12.13'. The strings were derived at run time and never written."
 },
